WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.615 --> 00:00:10.518
Besta rearranges the sessions
in this stundatafla to cut clashes.

2
00:00:10.618 --> 00:00:17.518
Only visible sessions move. Hidden
types and Festa tíma stay put –

3
00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:23.520
– but clashes with them, and the
rooms they use, still count.

4
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:29.522
Before registration opens, use last
year's numbers for room sizes.

5
00:00:29.622 --> 00:00:35.524
It runs on the server, a few
minutes; you can keep working.

6
00:00:35.624 --> 00:00:49.017
Done: proposals from fewest room
clashes to fewest student clashes.

7
00:00:49.117 --> 00:00:54.019
The summary compares the proposal
with Núverandi lausn.

8
00:00:54.119 --> 00:01:00.022
þyngsta lota: the worst single
session – a lower total is not all.

9
00:01:00.122 --> 00:01:06.776
Switch between them freely –
nothing changes until you save.

10
00:01:06.876 --> 00:01:13.042
A proposal can be adjusted
before you take it.

11
00:01:13.142 --> 00:01:17.045
Vista makes the proposal
Núverandi lausn.

12
00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:23.047
Moved sessions are magenta until
they are rebooked in TermTime.

13
00:01:23.147 --> 00:01:29.050
Spjall (the chat sheet) also gets
a full report of each run.
